  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After fleeing the area of translocation desert, Fang Yuan digs a simple sand cave, sets a mortal Gu formation, and races to activate this immortal killer move from Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance. Its sole core Immortal Gu is the rule path rank seven Fight Immortal Gu he obtained from Corpse City’s defensive Gu formation; the other worms are all mortal Gu and mostly wisdom path. As a rank seven immortal killer move it spends only three beads of red date immortal essence into Fight Immortal Gu. The first activation fails, destroys many mortal Gu, drops Fight Immortal Gu, and backlashes mainly into his soul and mind while his body stays only mildly hurt; after healing he fails a second time and succeeds on the third. Condensed profound light then shoots into Ying Wu Xie, enters brain and soul within a few breaths, and Ying Wu Xie surges up shouting that he must fight, smash Heavenly Court, destroy fate Gu, and follow Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1396
      ],
